2. Licence
   2.1 Subject to this agreement and to payment of the applicable fee, the Licensor grants you a
       non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable licence to install and use AlphaNav, for
       your own navigation, racing and boat-management purposes, for the term of your licence key.
   2.2 A licence key is issued for one plan: 1 month, 3 months, 6 months, 12 months, or with no end
       date. Your right to use AlphaNav ends when the term of your key ends, unless renewed.
   2.3 A licence key is issued for one machine, identified by the machine ID AlphaNav shows. You may
       use it only on that machine. Moving a licence to another machine requires a new key from the
       Licensor.
   2.4 Without a key you may use AlphaNav for a free trial of 30 days, once per machine, for
       evaluation only. Resetting, extending or repeating the trial, on the same machine or by
       any other means, is not permitted.
   2.5 Evaluation, beta or developer builds may be provided without a key. They are licensed for
       evaluation only, for as long as the Licensor allows.

